\p{Filed under [[conf-neuromod-nyc-2026]], category 3 (sense — vision). No people in the photo. Maps to the \strong{[V] Vision Prosthetics} class in [[bcf-0051]].}

\image{conf-usc-transcorneal-retina.jpg}

\p{\strong{Caption.} A computational platform (retina connectomics + FEM + NEURON) to place \strong{transcorneal / retro-orbital electrical stimulation} so that induced current density selectively targets \strong{outer retinal neurons} for neuroprotection in degeneration (e.g. AMD/RP), rather than just directly firing ganglion cells. The vision-side entry point of the "sense stimulation" axis — writing into the earliest sensory layer.}
